.TH LS 1 "January 2, 2026" "NetBSD Test Fixtures"
.SH NAME
ls \- list directory contents
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ls
.RB [ \-la ]
.RI [ file ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B ls
utility lists files in a directory.
The
.I file
operand names the directory to list.
.PP
Operands like <file> compare as a<b or a>b and pair as x&y.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cat (1),
.BR stat (2)
